WEBVTT

NOTE Actual app components with demonstration data. No real sends.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Understand a CME calculation — demonstration

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:11.401
Open Compliance and start with the dates being counted.

2
00:00:11.401 --> 00:00:20.423
A credit may be outside this renewal or have the wrong category.

3
00:00:20.423 --> 00:00:27.946
Read the rule's source and review date.

4
00:00:27.946 --> 00:00:38.222
If the app asks whether a condition applies, keep Not sure until you can confirm.

5
00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:46.985
Use Rules changed? to report a specific discrepancy.

6
00:00:46.985 --> 00:00:56.800
The calculation organizes your records; it does not approve your renewal.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.000
Try it with your own records. Review the result.
